@startuml
hide empty description
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #F8F8F8
  BorderColor #555555
}

state "No admission\nsafe: pump OFF" as Idle
state "Admitted\nsafe = requested" as Admitted
state "Tripped\nsafe vector:\npump OFF, valve ON" as Tripped

[*] --> Idle
Idle --> Admitted : fresh mode claim\npasses the envelope\n(scan 0: automatic, scan 4: manual)
Admitted --> Tripped : requested pump ON\nwith valve OFF\n(scan 1)
Tripped --> Tripped : valve request returns\nno automatic restart\n(scan 2)
Tripped --> Idle : neutral frame:\nall mode claims false\n(scan 3)
Admitted --> Idle : all mode claims false
@enduml
